# Field extraction

- If parameters are provided, emit exactly those fields (name/type from the parameter; value from OCR text or null if missing — never invent).
- If parameters are empty, infer document type from the OCR text (invoice, agreement, CV, PO, etc.) and recommend at most N useful fields with sensible types.
- Honor region/date hints in the instruction.
